<title>FINLAND: KESKO SAYS HAS 96.5 PCT OF TUKO SHARES.</title>
<headline>KESKO SAYS HAS 96.5 PCT OF TUKO SHARES.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish wholesaler Kesko Oy said in a statement on Monday it had bought 2,524,885 million shares in Tuko Oy based on its redemption offer in force in August.</p>
<p>&quot;After this, Kesko share of Tuko Oy's share capital rises to 96.5 percent and of votes to 99.8 percent,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>In the redemption offer announced on July 29, Kesko paid 55.76 markka per Tuko share, the same as in its other purchases of Tuko shares.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0245</p>
</text>
